# Rust
target/

# The compiled extensions. Build them with `uv sync --extra test --group dev`.
# A committed binary goes stale silently: it disagrees with `_core.pyi` and with
# the Rust it claims to be, and no gate can tell -- pytest imports the .so and
# passes while clippy checks source that never reached it.
*.so
*.pyd
*.dylib

